# The CLI's baseline store. It holds the URLs someone watches and the text of
# those pages -- a record of which vendors a practitioner is watching and when.
# That belongs on their disk and nowhere else, so it is ignored by default
# rather than left to be noticed in a diff.
vendor-watch-baselines.json
